{{!
  Home hero (SPEC sections 1 and 8): h1 with the tagline, e-mail link, Explore Artworks pill, then the media
  (poster picture + play button; hero.js plays the youtube-nocookie.com video over the poster on click and the
  same button then pauses and resumes it), arrow. The media comes after the text in the source, so the Tab
  order is e-mail, Explore Artworks, play; CSS places it behind the text as before.
}}
<header class="hero" id="top">
<div class="hero__content">
<h1 class="hero__title">Polina Shvedko Art <span class="hero__tagline">Oil paintings, pastels &amp; watercolours</span></h1>
<p class="hero__descr"><a class="hero__email" href="{{site.mailto}}" data-track="contact" data-location="hero">{{site.email}}</a></p>
<div class="hero__buttons"><a class="hero__cta" href="{{hero.cta_href}}">Explore Artworks</a></div>
</div>
<div class="hero__media">
{{#hero.poster}}{{> picture}}{{/hero.poster}}
<button type="button" class="hero__play" data-youtube-id="{{site.youtube_id}}" aria-label="Play the video">{{> icon-play}}{{> icon-pause}}</button>
</div>
<span class="hero__arrow" aria-hidden="true">{{> icon-arrow-down}}</span>
</header>
